UID:LBqMYJpCB4
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 90 mins (1h30m)\n\nRomanian Film Festival Seattle P
 resented by the American Romanian Cultural Society. Filmed in six countrie
 s during fifteen years\, The Last Transhumance takes us into the world of 
 shepherds who walk with their animals very long distances in search of foo
 d: an ancient way of life not compatible with the modern world.\n\nhttps:/
 /www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/romanian-film-festival-seattle-13th-editi
 on/the-last-transhumance\n\nEstimated start: 12:15
