UID:9VQiPenW3C
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 88 mins (1h28m)\n\nSeattle Film Critics Society PNW 
 Awards 2026Powwow People immerses us in a single day at a powwow\, guided 
 by Reuben Little Head’s humor and heart\, culminating in a long take hon
 oring community as privilege. Director Sky Hopinka scheduled to attend\, 
 with post-film Q&A moderated by critic Eric Zhu (The Insert\, Drink in the
  Movies).\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/seattle-film-critics
 -society-pnw-awards-2026/powwow-people\n\nEstimated start: 15:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
