BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Dune: Part Three
DTSTART:20261218T234500Z
DTEND:20261219T023000Z
DTSTAMP:20261218T234500Z
UID:JAWFYulOB5
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 150 mins (2h30m)\n\nDune: Part Three is set nearly t
 wo decades after Paul Atreides seized control of the Imperium. Now a ruthl
 ess Emperor\, Paul must face the consequences of his reign as old allies r
 eturn\, terrifying new threats emerge\, and betrayal lurks in every shadow
 . Haunted by visions of Imperial collapse and the reappearance of his long
 -lost love\, Paul is drawn into a sweeping conspiracy\, with Chani at the 
 heart of its unfolding mystery. As enemies close in\, Paul must confront t
 he true cost of power and the fate of those he loves the most.\n\nhttps://
 www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/dune-part-three\n\nEstimated start: 16:00
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
